                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A strange combination of a side-scrolling walking simulator with a choose-your-own-adventure game mechanic.\n\n[b]Star Sky[/b] is a delight to look at and the animation is simple but charming. The rules of the game are easy to master. After that, you repeat the same short walk over and over, triggering different combination of events until you exhaust all of the achievements. \n\nOddly, I found the experience relaxing. While not for everyone, if you're interested in slow-paced story telling this little gem might be for you.\n\nI purchased all three Star Sky games as a bundle so I cannot complain about value for money spent. I'm not sure I would recommend this game at full asking price.",
